---
layout: base.njk
css: blog.css
---
{% include "blogchrome.njk" %}
<main>
<article>
<p class="k">{{ site.meta.rackLabel }} · /blog</p>
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<div class="meta" style="margin-bottom:26px"><span>{{ page.date | isoDate }}</span>{% for t in topics %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="callout preface">
<p><strong>Best-effort writing, model-assisted.</strong> Writing is my nemesis — I don't have the patience to author. You can do the same as me: feed this page to your model and ask it to help you work it out. I've laid everything down; it only needs stitching together.</p>
</div>
{{ content | safe }}
</article>
<hr class="rule">
<div class="pager">
{%- set newer = collections.posts | getPreviousCollectionItem %}
{%- set older = collections.posts | getNextCollectionItem %}
{% if newer %}<a href="{{ newer.url }}"><span>← newer</span>{{ newer.data.title }}</a>{% else %}<span class="pager-gap"></span>{% endif %}
<a class="pager-all" href="/blog/">all posts</a>
{% if older %}<a href="{{ older.url }}" style="text-align:right"><span>older →</span>{{ older.data.title }}</a>{% else %}<span class="pager-gap"></span>{% endif %}
</div>
</main>
